	(text "Motor 1 off-board connections (DFRobot DRI0002 driver + 37D encoder motor)\nPWM on TIM3 (PA6), encoder on TIM2 (PA15 / PB3).\nEncoder Vcc is +5V, 2A from the TPS54202 buck (before the LDO), not from the MCU.\nDriver VS/GND and Motor+/- wire directly between DRI0002 and motor (not on this board)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 248.92 92.71 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
